        // The property we want to test is that c.redeemToken returns the amount of mAsset transferred to the caller.
        // To check that, we need to know the caller's mAsset balance before and after. We can call mAsset.balanceOf(address(this)).
        // Is that allowed? The constraints say: "Observe c ONLY through its PUBLIC/EXTERNAL surface... Do NOT read ANY other member of c."
